          "title": "Catan Card Game",
          "subtitle": "Accumulation",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Catan Card Game is a commercial two-player card adaptation of Catan focused on building settlements, roads, and resources through cards."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Designed by Klaus Teuber and published by Kosmos, the Catan Card Game adapts the Settlers of Catan resource-building system into a two-player card format."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Setup",
          "subtitle": "Table, deck, equipment, and deal",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "2 players use the table arrangement described for Catan Card Game."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Dedicated Catan Card Game deck"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Dedicated Catan Card Game deck, score area, and enough table space for play."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Each player sets up a small principality with settlement, road, and resource cards, then draws from development decks."
            }
          ]
